      "id": "til-hWNfMHd45zxLCmXLpRSH95",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T16:06:23.995000-06:00",
      "text": "A stem cell treatment took a person with type 1 diabetes from daily insulin shots to no insulin in 75 days. Type 1 is different from what I had. In type 1 the body attacks the cells that make insulin, so real food and\u2026",
      "url": "https://tilvids.com/videos/watch/8938e345-4f39-4333-a5ed-84fb939c3258",
