      "profileUrl": "https://tilvids.com/a/therealjimbbq/video-channels",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "til-nuLgZMVBcvgpSk5rEq8QwG",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T07:13:02.599000-06:00",
      "text": "Your brain runs on insulin too. It helps brain cells take in fuel and keep their connections healthy. When your cells stop listening to insulin, the problem doesn't stay in your blood sugar. Research has tied insulin\u2026",
      "url": "https://tilvids.com/videos/watch/ae1405fa-56b3-4abf-93d0-8696fd03b54c",
      "source": "tilvids"
