    },
    {
      "platform": "youtube",
      "platformLabel": "YouTube",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq",
      "profileUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFZpCMwcMX6EZicbuG-r6WA",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "yt-M-u7uvT1o4k",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-11T06:31:17-06:00",
      "text": "Jim breaks down why SGLT2 meds get prescribed for type 2 diabetes driven by insulin resistance, names a rare but serious genital infection risk you can look up, and brings it back to reversing the cause with food.\u2026",
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/M-u7uvT1o4k",
      "source": "youtube-rss"
    },
    {
      "platform": "youtube",
      "platformLabel": "YouTube",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq",
      "profileUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFZpCMwcMX6EZicbuG-r6WA",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "yt-WG_9j64EfoE",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-10T16:02:32-06:00",
      "text": "What if the sugar problem isn't mainly missing the gym, but overusing the chair? Overweight adults sat through a controlled day. Same food. Same chair. Then they did it again, except every 20 minutes they stood up for\u2026",
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/WG_9j64EfoE",
      "source": "youtube-rss"
    },
    {
      "platform": "mastodon",
      "platformLabel": "Mastodon",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq@mastodon.social",
      "profileUrl": "https://mastodon.social/@therealjimbbq",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "masto-117243803208072710",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T18:01:02.051000-06:00",
      "text": "2/2 I used to treat evening grazing like it did not count because dinner already \u201chappened.\u201d Then I noticed the mornings that felt foggy were also the nights the kitchen never really shut down. Protein and plants when\u2026",
      "url": "https://mastodon.social/@therealjimbbq/117243803208072710",
      "source": "mastodon"
    },
    {
      "platform": "mastodon",
      "platformLabel": "Mastodon",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq@mastodon.social",
      "profileUrl": "https://mastodon.social/@therealjimbbq",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "masto-117243799303138181",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T18:00:02.470000-06:00",
      "text": "1/2 Yesterday\u2019s feed was full of \u201cbuild muscle for glucose\u201d posters. Fine. True enough. Here is a quieter lever that does not need a cinematic program.When your eating window closes, close the kitchen with it.The late\u2026",
      "url": "https://mastodon.social/@therealjimbbq/117243799303138181",
      "source": "mastodon"
    },
    {
      "platform": "tilvids",
      "platformLabel": "TILvids",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq",
      "profileUrl": "https://tilvids.com/a/therealjimbbq/video-channels",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "til-98UkLEhpcDC4n48EoHPNaW",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T17:23:48.989000-06:00",
      "text": "Vaping gets sold as safer than smoking. Newer research links it to insulin resistance \u2014 the same metabolic mess tied to type 2 diabetes and heart disease. Worth a second look before you call it harmless. Let's get\u2026",
      "url": "https://tilvids.com/videos/watch/41e39266-385a-4f23-b16c-58dc2bb25760",
      "source": "tilvids"
    },
    {
      "platform": "tilvids",
      "platformLabel": "TILvids",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq",
      "profileUrl": "https://tilvids.com/a/therealjimbbq/video-channels",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "til-bhEYn8BadAcCkWC9JymFPN",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T12:49:46.796000-06:00",
      "text": "We've been told to fear cholesterol, avoid hormone therapy, trust opioids as low-risk, and keep peanuts away from kids. One by one those stories have cracked - and the apology never quite arrives. This clip stacks the\u2026",
      "url": "https://tilvids.com/videos/watch/534f4ddc-65ab-4525-a839-4a9f9afc5cb0",
      "source": "tilvids"
    },
    {
      "platform": "mastodon",
      "platformLabel": "Mastodon",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq@mastodon.social",
      "profileUrl": "https://mastodon.social/@therealjimbbq",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "masto-117242157507649756",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T11:02:30.703000-06:00",
      "text": "3/3 I cook for flavor first. The metabolic bonus is that real food in a window you can keep beats a fiber-oatmeal sermon at 7am that you never wanted. Skip the guilt. Own the window. Make the first plate count \u2014\u2026",
      "url": "https://mastodon.social/@therealjimbbq/117242157507649756",
      "source": "mastodon"
    },
    {
      "platform": "mastodon",
      "platformLabel": "Mastodon",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq@mastodon.social",
      "profileUrl": "https://mastodon.social/@therealjimbbq",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "masto-117242153486628391",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T11:01:29.316000-06:00",
      "text": "2/3 Researchers have long talked about a second-meal effect: what you eat at one meal can change how the next meal lands. Plain version \u2014 a steadier first meal in your window (meat, eggs, Greek yogurt, vegetables\u2026",
      "url": "https://mastodon.social/@therealjimbbq/117242153486628391",
      "source": "mastodon"
    },
    {
      "platform": "mastodon",
      "platformLabel": "Mastodon",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq@mastodon.social",
      "profileUrl": "https://mastodon.social/@therealjimbbq",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "masto-117242149198259676",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T11:00:23.964000-06:00",
      "text": "1/3 Blood sugar is not only about what you eat at noon. It is also about *when* your eating day starts.A lot of people feel better when breakfast is not a moral requirement. They open the day with coffee or water, then\u2026",
      "url": "https://mastodon.social/@therealjimbbq/117242149198259676",
      "source": "mastodon"
    },
    {
      "platform": "tilvids",
      "platformLabel": "TILvids",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq",
      "profileUrl": "https://tilvids.com/a/therealjimbbq/video-channels",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "til-7Xfb3Zw5NDceGdPhXq9ztM",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T07:53:06.600000-06:00",
      "text": "Mercer puts a number on next year\u2019s employer health cost jump: about +8.2% per worker in 2027 \u2014 biggest since 2003. After planned cuts; without them closer to 11%. Money stress doesn\u2019t stay in the wallet.",
      "url": "https://tilvids.com/videos/watch/384d7952-b606-40b4-bbdb-60a5e0e9b18f",
      "source": "tilvids"
    },
    {
      "platform": "youtube",
      "platformLabel": "YouTube",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq",
      "profileUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFZpCMwcMX6EZicbuG-r6WA",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "yt-ZjphZrC9Ob8",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T05:03:46-06:00",
      "text": "What if next year\u2019s health benefit costs increase enough to eat away at grocery money? Mercer just put a number on it. Employer health cost per worker is expected to go up about 8.2% in 2027 \u2014 the biggest jump since\u2026",
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/ZjphZrC9Ob8",
      "source": "youtube-rss"
    },
    {
      "platform": "youtube",
      "platformLabel": "YouTube",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq",
      "profileUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFZpCMwcMX6EZicbuG-r6WA",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "yt-MfLysIfqJDA",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-08T16:02:27-06:00",
      "text": "LDL gets the headlines. The quiet line on your lipid panel is triglycerides divided by HDL. That TG\u00f7HDL ratio tracks with insulin resistance and metabolic risk in the research \u2014 a cheap clue sitting next to numbers\u2026",
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/MfLysIfqJDA",
      "source": "youtube-rss"
    },
    {
      "platform": "tilvids",
      "platformLabel": "TILvids",
      "handle": "@therealjimbbq",
      "profileUrl": "https://tilvids.com/a/therealjimbbq/video-channels",
      "displayName": "The Healthy Pitmaster",
      "id": "til-eaRD8dKxid2AjQt4fFMkzF",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-08T09:41:29.311000-06:00",
      "text": "Most portals highlight LDL and A1c. A quieter ratio \u2014 triglycerides divided by HDL \u2014 can flag insulin resistance earlier than those two alone.",
      "url": "https://tilvids.com/videos/watch/6aa7169a-764b-4069-8dfe-91ebd0c008c5",
      "source": "tilvids"
    }
